---
description: Rules for editing Bicep and pipelines (infra repo)
globs: bicep/**,pipelines/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Keep modules small in `bicep/modules/`; `main.bicep` only wires modules together.
- Every parameter has a `@description`; the cheapest SKU is the default.
- Never output secrets (listKeys is only used internally in app settings). App secrets are set by the app pipeline, not by Bicep; if infra ever needs a secret, read it with `readEnvironmentVariable()` in `.bicepparam`.
- Validate with `az bicep build --file bicep/main.bicep --stdout > /dev/null` and `az bicep build-params --file bicep/env/<env>.bicepparam --stdout > /dev/null`. Never run a deployment.
- Pipelines: use templates in `pipelines/templates/` and per-environment variables in `pipelines/variables/<env>.yml`.
- All comments, descriptions and displayNames are in English.
